Jovimetrix was created by Alexander G. Morano and is maintained by Jordan Thompson (WASasquatch).

This project includes code from cozy_comfyui (MIT), the support library Alexander G. Morano
wrote for Jovimetrix, taken at commit 6f37572 and carried in modules/ with changes: the
ComfyUI loader, logger and routes were replaced, OpenCV, numba, scikit-learn, scikit-image,
matplotlib and requests were replaced with torch, numpy, Pillow, scipy and the standard library,
and defects were fixed.
