modules/image/data/opencv_colormaps.png holds the 22 colour tables of OpenCV's applyColorMap,
sampled from OpenCV 4.13. They come from OpenCV's modules/imgproc/src/colormap.cpp, which is
distributed under the terms below. Its TURBO table is Google's Turbo colormap (Apache 2.0),
https://ai.googleblog.com/2019/08/turbo-improved-rainbow-colormap-for.html
https://github.com/opencv/opencv

